# Workflow files are pinned to LF on purpose.
#
# A `run: |` block is bash, and bash on the Linux runner treats a trailing
# carriage return as part of the command -- so a workflow committed from
# Windows with CRLF endings fails with "$'\r': command not found" on a line
# that looks perfectly correct in an editor. This repository has
# core.autocrlf=true, which makes that a real possibility rather than a
# theoretical one.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
